Package: unitregTMB
Type: Package
Title: Regression Models for Correlated Continuous Bounded Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ricardo Rasmussen", "Petterle", email = "ricardopetterle@ufpr.br", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7735-1077")),
    person("Wagner H.", "Bonat", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: A computationally efficient framework for modeling continuous bounded data (e.g., proportions, rates, fractions) using Template Model Builder (TMB). Provides 16 distribution families across mean, mode, and quantile parameterizations (including Kumaraswamy, unit-Weibull, unit-Gompertz, and Vasicek), natively supporting exact zero- and one-inflation components, as well as complex random effects structures.
